@title Fixing the last warning says so once, quietly
@area Schematic
# Polish: when a finished check finds no error or warning where the one before found some, one plain info line says "No errors or warnings left". No glow, no animation. Here a placed coil raises a warning and Undo removes it. The text is in the toast and the status bar.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key q
text coil
key Return
click 600 300
wait 10
key Escape
wait_s 2
shot warning-present
key ctrl+z
wait_s 2
expect "No errors or warnings left"
shot all-clear
check_layout
